// ============================================================
// STYLE 5: Storybook Kids  (template + demo topic)
// Topic: "Pip Counts Her Friends" - counting 1 to 5 (ages 5-9)
// Look: one pastel page per scene (rounded page with plum outline),
//   soft translucent dots, VERY large friendly text, ONE short
//   sentence per scene, characters built only from circles/ellipses.
// Recipe per page: sentence on top | big number badge on the left |
//   creatures in the middle with bouncing count tags | Pip peeks in.
// Palette: text plum #3B2F4A, number coral #C2334D, pastel pages.
// Reuse: change the sentence, number and creature builder per scene.
// ============================================================
VERSION 1.0
CANVAS 1920 1080
BACKGROUND #FFF8E7
BOARD plain
STYLE handdrawn
FONT handwritten
STROKE 5
SUBTITLES off

